PathOps Dex

This repository contains build tooling and a patch set for Dex
(https://github.com/dexidp/dex), which is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Dex source code is not vendored here; it is fetched from the
upstream release pinned in UPSTREAM_VERSION and UPSTREAM_COMMIT.

The files under patches/ modify Dex. Each patch states the upstream files it
changes and why. Images built from this repository contain the modified Dex
binary, the upstream LICENSE and a PathOps notice under
/usr/share/doc/pathops-dex/.

The build scripts, workflows and patches in this repository are licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).
